{"l":9150,"g":9,"b":3,"cefr":"C1","role":"deep_challenge","insight":"perspective_shift","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'Had we left ten minutes earlier, we ___ the train.'","o":["would catch","will have caught","would have caught","had caught"],"a":"would have caught","r":"'Had we left' er en inverteret type 3-betingelse (= If we had left), så hovedsætningen skal have 'would have' + kort tillægsform."},
{"l":9160,"g":9,"b":3,"cefr":"C1","role":"deep_challenge","insight":"perspective_shift","k":"o","variant":"authored","q":"Hvad betyder 'mediocre' i 'The food was mediocre, but the view was fantastic.'?","o":["fremragende","kold","dyr","middelmådig"],"a":"middelmådig","r":"'Mediocre' betyder middelmådig, hverken god eller dårlig. 'But' viser kontrasten til den fantastiske udsigt."},
