{"l":9180,"g":9,"b":3,"cefr":"C1","role":"deep_challenge","insight":"perspective_shift","k":"o","variant":"authored","q":"Hvad hedder 'overbevisende' på engelsk i 'Her argument was so ___ that the whole class changed its mind.'?","o":["pervasive","persuasive","permissive","perceptive"],"a":"persuasive","r":"'Persuasive' betyder overbevisende. 'Permissive' betyder eftergivende, og 'perceptive' betyder skarpsindig."},
